  - voltage: 4.100
    beam: 330
    description: The voltage has reached 4.1 volts. Continue adjusting until the
      voltage is below 4.1 volts and the beam level is above 350.
    voiceKey: CONTROL_MACHINE_VOLTAGE_4_1
  - voltage: 4.000
    beam: 360
    description: The voltage and beam level are now within the safe operating range.
    voiceKey: CONTROL_MACHINE_SAFE_RANGE
  endWait: 3
